    {
        "text": "Nfts can be used by Dapps to issue unique digital items and crypto collectibles as unique collectibles. These tokens have a resale value on the market, and the NFT market has been growing rapidly in trading volume despite being volatile like the overall crypto market. Another benefit of NFTs is that they could mitigate some common problems faced by many online gaming ecosystems. Some online games have already built sizable gaming economies. Using blockchain to tokenize gaming assets is a solution to alleviate challeng such as management of gaming economies and proof of ownership. Depending on the blockchain they are minted on. NFTs could also allow players to take some of their in game assets outside of the game ecosystem, allowing gaming worlds to connect to each other.",
